          "message": "ci: trim benchmark/accuracy catalogs and de-brittle the shape test (#1524)\n\n- models.json: drop the DeepSeek-R1-0528 throughput-benchmark entry (still\n  covered as an accuracy model; benchmark trend intentionally retired) and\n  remove its now-orphan deepseek-r1-0528 workflow_dispatch toggle so\n  test_workflow_dispatch_inputs_match_catalog stays green.\n- models_accuracy.json: drop the GLM-5.1-FP8 and MiniMax-M2.7-MXFP4 accuracy\n  entries; promote GLM-5.2-MXFP4 MTP from nightly to pr gating.\n- test_benchmark_catalog.py: replace the brittle 'len(variants) == 22' golden\n  assertion with a content-agnostic non-empty + per-variant shape check so\n  adding/removing a model no longer forces a hand-edit; drop the stale '13'\n  count from a docstring.\n\nCI: test_benchmark_catalog.py 14 passed, validate_catalog.py all catalogs\nvalid, atom-benchmark.yaml parses.",
