          "id": "09a274db7fa65d457d95b3e4cae8f329e8710b3a",
          "message": "Add review-pr skill: automated ATOM PR review checklist (#1539)\n\nAdds a Claude Code skill at .claude/skills/review-pr/SKILL.md that\nprovides a structured, multi-section checklist for reviewing ATOM PRs.\n\nCovers: backbone tier safety (B1-B4), data-type consistency (D1-D8,\nunified numbering with aiter skill, D3 intentionally skipped as\naiter-only), correctness hazards (C1-C3), performance flags (P1-P4),\nhardware-specific checks (HK1-HK7), FP8 correctness (F1-F6),\nmulti-stream sync (G1), EP vs TP parallelism confusion check, LDS\nbudget verification, and a blind-spot self-check before verdict (Step 7.5).\n\nTested against 4 real PRs: aiter #4156, #4157 and ATOM #1527, #1526.\n\nCo-authored-by: root <root@hjbog-srdc-24.amd.com>",
