          "id": "b2ca63cc41de02253700437dd5d63ac5d8b262f6",
          "message": "feat(tbo): skip prefill TBO below a min token count\n\nSplitting a small prefill into 2 ubatches goes memory-bound and the split\noverhead outweighs the overlap. Skip TBO when per-rank prefill tokens\n< ATOM_TBO_PREFILL_MIN_TOKENS (default 8192). Gated identically in\nlocal_tbo_precompute and maybe_create_ubatch_slices; prefill-only, decode\nuntouched; AND-reduced across DP so ranks stay in lockstep.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-09T14:43:18Z",
          "url": "https://github.com/ROCm/ATOM/commit/b2ca63cc41de02253700437dd5d63ac5d8b262f6"
