          "id": "e10dbfaf154ef5fbc0281c8115facef763aafc9b",
          "message": "[experiment] DPA TBO: streaming-only abort (disable non-stream disconnect-abort)\n\nVariant of main for the DSV4-Pro DPA TBO 8k1k/c=1024 CI comparison:\nkeep streaming abort-on-real-disconnect (cleanup_streaming_request aborted=),\nbut disable the non-streaming _race_disconnect abort path (revert to pre-1562\nnon-stream behavior: just await the coro, no _listen_for_disconnect task, no\nabort_request). Isolates whether the non-stream disconnect machinery matters.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: yihonglie <hyi@amd.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-17T08:09:04Z",
