          "id": "484cf36ef74d1f8eebf114a2eea61a449121fe37",
          "message": "[diag] log waiting-prefill queue depth + free VRAM at prefill schedule\n\nHunting the DPA TBO 8k1k/c=1024 OOM (HSA_STATUS_ERROR_OUT_OF_RESOURCES,\nfree mem 0MB). Augment the 'Scheduled prefill batch' log with waiting_prefill\n(queue depth), kv_free_blocks, and free_vram (torch.cuda.mem_get_info) so we\ncan watch VRAM approach 0 before the crash.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: yihonglie <hyi@amd.com>",
