          "id": "d078f89b2c9e2a476bd4fef88f927c4d291f5c7a",
          "message": "perf(tbo): give V4 prefill ubatches their own metadata buffers\n\nRoot-cause fix replacing the finally+sync workaround. The prefill ubatch\nmetadata build borrowed the shared global forward_vars buffers\n(context_lens/block_tables), overwrote them, let helpers launch async H2D\nfrom them, then restored in finally. With the host-scalar path's .item()\nsyncs gone, that restore (or the next ubatch's borrow) could clobber the\npinned source before its non_blocking copy landed -> OOB index bounds\n(HSA 0x1016).\n\nInstead, each ubatch now reads/writes its own ub{idx}_ prefixed buffer\nset (context_lens / v4_batch_id_per_token / v4_n_committed_csa_per_seq /\nv4_indexer_cu_committed), mirroring the decode TBO path. No shared source,\nno restore, so no stream sync is needed -- overlap is fully preserved.\nThe ub{0,1}_ buffers are now allocated whenever enable_tbo is set (not\njust enable_tbo_decode).",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-21T01:16:10Z",
          "url": "https://github.com/ROCm/ATOM/commit/d078f89b2c9e2a476bd4fef88f927c4d291f5c7a"
