          "id": "2473b7c1a162ebb29dd8880c68d4e7c86d4e0977",
          "message": "(eplb): EPLB_V_0.9 (#1210)\n\n* feat: eplb_module_A, eplb record\n\n* feat: eplb_module_B, eplb scheduler\n\n* fix: eplb freeze guard, dtype assert, generator skeleton, extended tests\n\n* fix(eplb): make count_physical_load hip/cuda-graph capture-safe\n\nbincount + boolean-mask indexing + `.any()` host-sync raise\n\"operation not permitted when stream is capturing\" inside the decode\ncudagraph. Replace with fixed-shape scatter_add_ so the module-A record\nhook can run within graph capture (return value unchanged).\n\n* feat:eplb_module_C, rearrange\n\n* feat:eplb_module_D, migrate\n\n* resolve conflict\n\n* fix hang\n\n* 1、format 2、using clean select_expert_with_record only in mxfp4moe\n3、check continugous\n\n* fix: policy abstract\n\n* fix: clean code\n\n* test case fix\n\n* feat: optional biased sticky\n\n* fix code style\n\n* fix: config style and do not update expert_map and expert_mask\n\n* fix: remove intermediate variable num_physical_experts and num_logical_experts\n\n* feat: only for pure prefill\n\n* fix: load weight count\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: JiaoliangYu <jiaolyu@amd.com>",
